# Project Architecture

StudyForge uses a Django / Django REST Framework backend and a React + TypeScript frontend.

- Respect domain ownership boundaries. Do not create unrelated features.
- Do not introduce new top-level architecture without justification.
- Read `docs/` before implementing a feature.
- Follow the documented API and database contracts in `docs/api-contract.md` and `docs/database-schema.md`.
- Do not hard-code secrets or environment URLs.
- Inspect the existing implementation before modifying shared files.
